<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Conquering now and still to conquer,</l><l>Who is this wonderful King?</l><l>Whence are the armies which He leade</l><l>While of His glory they sing?</l><l>He is our Lord and Redeemer,</l><l>Savior and Monarch divine;</l><l>They are the stars that forever</l><l>Bright in His kingdom will shine.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Conquering now and still to conquer,</l><l>Jesus, Thou Ruler of all,</l><l>Thrones and their scepters all shall perish,</l><l>Crowns and their splendor shall fall,</l><l>Yet shall the armies Thou leadest</l><l>Faithful and true to the last,</l><l>Find in Thy kingdom eternal</l><l>Rest, when their warfare is past.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
